OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 13 JAN
OL,4,G0700FNick Grimshaw
OL,5,     GBeth Ditto is back for her weekly
OL,6,     Gcatch up with Nick and they
OL,7,     Greflect on their musical memories
OL,8,     Gof the 90s, ahead of 6 Music's
OL,9,     G90s Forever this Friday.
OL,10,G1000FLauren Laverne
OL,11,     GLauren gives you the finest blend
OL,12,     Gof fantastic music for your
OL,13,     GTuesday morning.
OL,14,G1300FCraig Charles
OL,15,     GJason and Andrew of Sleaford Mods
OL,16,     Gput their music tastes to the
OL,17,     Gtest in a 6 Music Fight Club! Who
OL,18,     Gwins? That's up to you to decide!
OL,19,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,20,     GAnjali Perin explores how melody
OL,21,     Gcan be structured in songs in
OL,22,     Gthis week's 6 Musicology.
